WEBVTT

00:46.000 --> 00:51.000
Seann daoine a’ falbh

00:51.000 --> 00:56.000
Toirt ceum bho ar saoghal

00:56.000 --> 01:00.000
Dèanamh air beatha eile

01:00.000 --> 01:04.000
Tòiseachadh as ùr

01:04.000 --> 01:09.000
Oh nach till sibh a-nall

01:09.000 --> 01:14.000
Thar nan cuantan ’s nam beann

01:14.000 --> 01:22.000
Is togaibh fonn aon uair eile

01:24.000 --> 01:29.000
